            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಯೋಧ — yōdha — \"a warrior\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಆ ಯೋಧ ಯುದ್ಧದಲ್ಲಿ ಊರನ್ನು ಕಾಪಾಡಿದನು. ā yōdha yuddhadalli ūrannu kāpāḍidanu. That warrior protected the town in the war."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: ಯೋಧರು, yōdharu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Today it is also a respectful word for a soldier: ನಮ್ಮ ಯೋಧರು."
            }
          ]
        },
