              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹೋರಾಡು — hōrāḍu — \"to fight; to struggle\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ರೈತರು ತಮ್ಮ ನೆಲಕ್ಕಾಗಿ ಹೋರಾಡಿದರು. raitaru tamma nelakkāgi hōrāḍidaru. The farmers fought for their land."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ಹೋರಾಡಿದೆ, hōrāḍide."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What one fights for takes -ಆಗಿ: ನ್ಯಾಯಕ್ಕಾಗಿ ಹೋರಾಡು (hōrāḍu), to fight for justice."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹೋರಾಡು (hōrāḍu) is a native Dravidian compound: pōr, \"to fight, to wrestle\" (DEDR 4540), whose p- became h-, and āḍu, \"to move, to act\" (DEDR 347)."
            }
          ]
        },
