              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ಹಿಮ್ಮೆಟ್ಟಿದೆ, himmeṭṭide."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹಿಂ, back, and ಮೆಟ್ಟು, to step: to step back."
            }
